    <string name="run_grammar_unavailable">Grammar Check cannot run in this build: its prompt is missing from the registry. Nothing was sent, because falling back to the default style would rewrite the text instead of correcting it.</string>
    <string name="run_no_reason">The text tools answered with neither a result nor a reason.</string>

    <string name="models_heading">Model per tool</string>
    <string name="models_note">Text Enhance, Grammar Check and Summary each run on their own model. Translate has none to choose: it goes to the translation engine, never to a chat model.</string>
    <string name="provider_label">Provider</string>
    <string name="model_for_tool">Model for %1$s</string>

    <string name="token_note">Cloud Writer holds no API key. It names a provider and a model; the app that serves the tools makes the request with its own credential, and only the text crosses between them.</string>

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         THE FOUR CONFIGURATION PAGES.

         COPIED FROM cloud-keyboard, NOT SHARED WITH IT. Every string below is
         the same wording as the matching key in ab_cloud-libs-shared/libs/
         keyboard/src/main/res — same name, same sentence, same Spanish twin —
         and it is cloud-writer's OWN resource. Nothing here reads the
         keyboard's resources, its preferences or its activities; changing a
         value on one of these pages changes nothing in the keyboard and the
         keyboard changing changes nothing here. That separation is the whole
         point of the task (209: "WHY I CANT EDIT NOTHING"), and it is why the
         wording is duplicated rather than factored into a shared module — a
         shared module is "linked" wearing a different hat.

         WHERE THE WORDING DELIBERATELY DIFFERS it is marked DIVERGENCE and
         says why. There are four, all of them places where the keyboard's
         sentence would be a lie in this app.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

