         and nothing is missing, but only the default target language reaches
         this app's Translate button today. Said out loud rather than left to
         be discovered. -->
    <string name="translate_writer_note">Only the default target language above changes what Cloud Writer\'s Translate button does. Auto-detect, the primary action and typing straight into the field are translate-BAR behaviours and belong to the keyboard; they are stored here so this page matches, and they act only if this app ever grows a bar of its own.</string>

