         this row is READ-ONLY and says where the key actually lives. Removing
         the row instead would leave the owner hunting for a setting that is
         simply somewhere else. -->
    <string name="ai_token_writer_summary">Not held here, and there is no field for it on purpose. Cloud Writer names a provider and a model; the app that serves the tools makes the request with its own key. Set the key in that app — Cloud Keyboard → Settings → AI Model Routing.</string>
